                {manager && page === 'promotions' && <><PageTools><Button className="primary" icon="plus" onClick={() => promotionForm()}>Promoción</Button></PageTools><div className="legend" style={{ margin: '0 2px' }}><span><i style={{ background: 'var(--amber-bar)' }} />Horario activo</span><span><i style={{ background: 'var(--control)' }} />Promoción inactiva</span><span><i style={{ background: 'var(--red)', width: 3 }} />Ahora · {String(Math.floor(mexicoNow)).padStart(2, '0')}:{String(Math.round((mexicoNow % 1) * 60)).padStart(2, '0')}</span></div>{list('promotions').length ? <div className="stack stagger">{list('promotions').map((p: Row) => { const now = p.active && mexicoNow >= p.startHour && mexicoNow < p.endHour, left = p.startHour - mexicoNow; const state = !p.active ? 'Desactivada' : now ? 'Aplicando ahora' : left > 0 ? 'Empieza en ' + (Math.floor(left) ? Math.floor(left) + ' h ' : '') + Math.round((left % 1) * 60) + ' min' : 'Terminó a las ' + p.endHour + ':00'; return <section className={'card promo-card' + (p.active ? '' : ' inactive')} key={p.id}><div className="promo-head"><div className="ph"><Sq icon="percent" tone={p.active ? 'amber' : undefined} /><div><h3>{p.name} {p.combo && <Pill tone="purple">Combo</Pill>}</h3><p>{p.startHour}:00 a {p.endHour}:00 · hora de Ciudad de México</p></div></div><div className="promo-side"><div className="pct"><b className="num">−{p.percent} %</b><small>{state}</small></div><Switch checked={!!p.active} label={p.active ? 'Activa' : 'Inactiva'} onChange={() => run(() => action('promotion.save', { id: p.id, name: p.name, productIds: p.productIds, percent: p.percent, startHour: p.startHour, endHour: p.endHour, combo: p.combo, active: !p.active }))} /><Button className="ghost sm" icon="edit" onClick={() => promotionForm(p)}>Editar</Button></div></div><div style={{ marginTop: 16 }}><div className="hour-track"><i className={p.active ? '' : 'off'} style={{ left: p.startHour / 24 * 100 + '%', width: (p.endHour - p.startHour) / 24 * 100 + '%' }} /><em style={{ left: mexicoNow / 24 * 100 + '%' }} /></div><div className="hour-axis">{[0, 3, 6, 9, 12, 15, 18, 21, 24].map(h => <span key={h}>{h}:00</span>)}</div></div><div className="chips" style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>{p.productIds.map((pid: string) => <span className="tag" key={pid}>{item('products', pid)?.name || 'Producto'}</span>)}</div></section>; })}</div> : <section className="card panel"><EmptyState icon="percent" title="Sin promociones" text="Crea una promoción por horario o un combo." /></section>}</>}
                {page === 'support' && supportScreen()}
